# Chlorine · Cl · gate 17

**Chlorine** (Cl) is element **17** of the periodic table — a **halogen**, period 3, group 17, p-block, gas at standard conditions, atomic weight **35.45**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Green choking gas; disinfects water and bleaches cloth — and was the first chemical weapon.

